        <div class="inline-block border-b-4 border-[#a567ad] px-2 py-3 min-w-[52%] max-sm:min-w-0">
          <h2 data-id="pg114_n0003" class="adt-h2 text-[#2b2525]">Ndotja e tok&#xeb;s</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-5 text-left text-[#3a2f2a]">
      <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed">
        <span data-id="pg114_n0005">M&#xeb;suesja u dha detyr&#xeb; nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;sve q&#xeb; t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rgatitnin nj&#xeb; projekt me tem&#xeb; sipas d&#xeb;shir&#xeb;s.</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0006">Disa nx&#xeb;n&#xeb;s mor&#xeb;n p&#xeb;r tem&#xeb; instrumentin m&#xeb; t&#xeb; p&#xeb;lqyer, disa p&#xeb;rgatit&#xeb;n projekt p&#xeb;r kafsh&#xeb;n e dashur e disa p&#xeb;r bim&#xeb;t.</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0007">H&#xeb;na po mendonte se cil&#xeb;n tem&#xeb; ta merrte.</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0008">D&#xeb;shironte q&#xeb; t&#xeb; hulumtonte nj&#xeb; tem&#xeb; p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; cil&#xeb;n nuk kishte shum&#xeb; informata, por q&#xeb; do t&#xeb; ishte e dobishme p&#xeb;r t&#xeb;.</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0009">Ishte n&#xeb; mes t&#xeb; kafsh&#xeb;s m&#xeb; t&#xeb; p&#xeb;lqyer, bim&#xeb;s m&#xeb; interesante apo trupit t&#xeb; njeriut.</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0010">Nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; q&#xeb; po mendonte, iu kujtua se k&#xeb;to tri gjallesa kan&#xeb; di&#xe7;ka t&#xeb; p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t.</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0011">Q&#xeb; t&#xeb; tria jetojn&#xeb; n&#xeb; Tok&#xeb;, prandaj ajo mendoi q&#xeb; t&#xeb; hulumtonte p&#xeb;r Tok&#xeb;n.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed">
        <span data-id="pg114_n0013">Nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; q&#xeb; po mblidhte informacione p&#xeb;r form&#xeb;n e Tok&#xeb;s, origjin&#xeb;n e emrit e karakteristika t&#xeb; tjera, asaj i t&#xeb;rhoqi v&#xeb;mendjen fjalia:</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0014">&quot;N&#xeb; Sistemin Diellor ka tet&#xeb; planet&#xeb; dhe VET&#xcb;M n&#xeb; planetin Tok&#xeb; &#xeb;sht&#xeb; e mundshme jeta p&#xeb;r gjallesat&quot;.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed">
        <span data-id="pg114_n0016">Fakte, si: sa ka uj&#xeb; n&#xeb; Tok&#xeb;, p&#xeb;rb&#xeb;rja e ajrit, sateliti natyral i Tok&#xeb;s etj., po i b&#xeb;nin p&#xeb;rshtypje H&#xeb;n&#xeb;s.</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0017">Ajo mendoi q&#xeb; t&#xeb; ndryshonte tem&#xeb;n e projektit, do t&apos;u tregonte shok&#xeb;ve dhe shoqeve t&#xeb; klas&#xeb;s p&#xeb;r r&#xeb;nd&#xeb;sin&#xeb; e planetit Tok&#xeb;.</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0018">- Un&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; b&#xeb;j gj&#xeb;ra t&#xeb; vogla me dashuri t&#xeb; madhe p&#xeb;r planetin tim, - mendoi ajo.</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0019">H&#xeb;na u p&#xeb;rqendrua te veprimet e d&#xeb;mshme q&#xeb; mund t&#xeb; b&#xeb;jn&#xeb; f&#xeb;mij&#xeb;t ndaj tok&#xeb;s.</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0020">Ne hedhim mbeturina n&#xeb; tok&#xeb;.</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0021">Ne shpenzojm&#xeb; shum&#xeb; uj&#xeb; pa nevoj&#xeb;.</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0022">Ne nuk riciklojm&#xeb;.</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0023">Ne d&#xeb;mtojm&#xeb; hap&#xeb;sirat e gjelb&#xeb;ruara kur ecim n&#xeb; bar e jo n&#xeb; rrug&#xeb;n e shtruar.</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0024">Ne d&#xeb;mtojm&#xeb; lulet nd&#xeb;rkoh&#xeb; q&#xeb; duhet t&#xeb; kujdesemi p&#xeb;r to.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="adt-body leading-relaxed">
        <span data-id="pg114_n0026">N&#xeb; fund t&#xeb; prezantimit t&#xeb; projektit, ajo k&#xeb;rkoi nga shoqet dhe shok&#xeb;t e klas&#xeb;s q&#xeb; t&#xeb; vizatonin di&#xe7;ka q&#xeb; ata mund t&#xeb; b&#xeb;nin ndryshe p&#xeb;r t&#xeb; mir&#xeb;n e planetit.</span>
        <span data-id="pg114_n0027">H&#xeb;na e p&#xeb;rmbylli prezantimin duke th&#xeb;n&#xeb; me z&#xeb; t&#xeb; lart&#xeb;: &quot;&#xcb;sht&#xeb; e mira jon&#xeb; e p&#xeb;rbashk&#xeb;t, prandaj duhet ta ruajm&#xeb; me &#xe7;do kusht!&quot;.</span>
      </p>
